The documentation, patches and measurements in this repository were collected while working on a
specific unit of the **HUAWEI MateBook GT 14 (ENZH-XX)**; the primary data (logs, exchange dumps,
frames) is in `docs/` as excerpts, and the methodology is in the respective sections.

## What is deliberately NOT published

* **The fingerprint sensor PSK** (`/var/lib/fprintd/gxfp/psk_raw32.bin`) and provisioning dumps
  (`gxfp_psk_tool --dump-bb010002/3`) — these are per-device, every unit has its own; they are not
  in the repository and must not be.
* **Raw exchange logs** from the probe (`/dev/gxfp`) — may contain per-device data.
* **The MOK enrollment password** and any signing keys — scrubbed from the documentation; every
  user creates their own key (`docs/04-secureboot-mok.md`).

